    "created_at": "2016-03-17T14:46:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-03-17T14:46:31Z",
    "body": "> I guess I didn't realise that's how environment settings objects worked.\n\nIt looks like I messed that up recently, and it wasn't really supposed to work that way. I'll work toward correcting that today. But also it sounds like I should move it to Document anyway so that the module map doesn't get blown away in the document.open() case.\n",
